      "id": "claim_1f71c14e89574734acd22c1f76c31751",
      "statement": "Conformetry is a template-driven code generation and conformance validation toolchain where generators render templates to instances, languages compare instances against templates structurally, and validation reports differences with conformance scores that gate CI.",
