      "id": "claim_92d813dfaedf4a61a0b0a329f5154a41",
      "statement": "Conformance scoring computes a 0-1 score per instance: totalWeight sums all template requirements (existence + content), missingWeight sums weights of deduplicated differences, score = 1 - missingWeight/totalWeight, gated by generator threshold or CLI --threshold.",
